# Phase 1 — Understanding Aurora DAS Encryption

## Objective

Understand how Aurora protects database activity using envelope encryption instead of treating AWS Lambda as a black box.

## Flow

```text
Aurora
   │
   ▼
Encrypted DAS Record
   │
   ▼
Kinesis Stream
   │
   ▼
decrypt_record.py
   │
   ├── kms.decrypt()
   ├── AWS Encryption SDK
   ├── zlib.decompress()
   ▼
Readable Database Activity JSON
```

### Outcome

- Read encrypted DAS records
- Understand envelope encryption
- Manually decrypt records
- Recover original SQL statements

