# Phase 2 — Production Monitoring Pipeline

## Objective

Build the AWS production architecture that continuously monitors database activity.

## Flow

```text
Aurora DAS
      │
      ▼
Kinesis Stream
      │
      ├──────────────► Firehose RAW
      │                     │
      │                     ▼
      │             raw-encrypted/
      │
      ▼
Firehose Parsed
      │
      ▼
Lambda
      │
      ├── Decrypt
      ├── Parse
      ├── Classify
      ├── Generate Alerts
      ▼
parsed/
SNS
```

### Firehose RAW

Purpose:

- Archive encrypted DAS records
- Replay and forensic analysis
- Demonstrate manual decryption

### Firehose Parsed

Purpose:

- Decrypt records automatically
- Store readable JSON
- Generate security alerts
- Feed SIEM / Athena / dashboards

